    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, the player will play the role of a person bound by the sword, the sword absorbs essence and blood for a living, nourishes his body with flesh and blood, in order to survive, you will be in this virtual world non-stop killing,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find more essence blood for the sword, and in return, you will gain great power, and if one day you can no longer provide for the sword, the next provider of essence blood may be you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will experience the thrill of battle in the fantasy world, and the unique talent system allows you to have more choices for attribute allocation, and the reasonable allocation of these attribute points will bring you a different combat experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a unique top-down action design gameplay, you can defeat powerful monsters through combat skills such as rolling and charged attacks, or you can remotely pull away to consume opponents, with a variety of battle strategy options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a talent attribute point system and a weapon skill system, which I call the &quot;Life Weapon System&quot; here</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduction to Talent Point System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/966eb55cf14a41f7a0010225f71e8767.avif?t=1752120241\" data-has-big width=800 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can assign different attribute points and match them to create the most suitable attribute scheme for themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduction to the Life Weapon System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/4f4e99559c2106f9c285e7d2bbca00e0.avif?t=1752120241\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players unlock different skill effects through talent points, making you stronger! By combining attacks from different angles, a more magnificent performance effect can be achieved</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/cc52bf99e709a4c359a4f0eb53d608b5.poster.avif?t=1752120241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/cc52bf99e709a4c359a4f0eb53d608b5.webm?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/cc52bf99e709a4c359a4f0eb53d608b5.mp4?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brilliant visual effects and excellent atomization interaction effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/6bf6143f44faad4cba37bcf5236405b2.poster.avif?t=1752120241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/6bf6143f44faad4cba37bcf5236405b2.webm?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/6bf6143f44faad4cba37bcf5236405b2.mp4?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive drops bring a refreshing sensation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/60ad266d2a270fb0ab6df2a8b4aa3253.poster.avif?t=1752120241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/60ad266d2a270fb0ab6df2a8b4aa3253.webm?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/60ad266d2a270fb0ab6df2a8b4aa3253.mp4?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/6093258917249791e71ab71749ddc41c.poster.avif?t=1752120241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/6093258917249791e71ab71749ddc41c.webm?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/6093258917249791e71ab71749ddc41c.mp4?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome everyone to download and try it out, and provide valuable improvement suggestions. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ group: 719286397, welcome to join!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, the player will play the role of a person bound by the sword, the sword absorbs essence and blood for a living, nourishes his body with flesh and blood, in order to survive, you will be in this virtual world non-stop killing,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find more essence blood for the sword, and in return, you will gain great power, and if one day you can no longer provide for the sword, the next provider of essence blood may be you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will experience the thrill of battle in the fantasy world, and the unique talent system allows you to have more choices for attribute allocation, and the reasonable allocation of these attribute points will bring you a different combat experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a unique top-down action design gameplay, you can defeat powerful monsters through combat skills such as rolling and charged attacks, or you can remotely pull away to consume opponents, with a variety of battle strategy options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a talent attribute point system and a weapon skill system, which I call the &quot;Life Weapon System&quot; here</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduction to Talent Point System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/966eb55cf14a41f7a0010225f71e8767.avif?t=1752120241\" data-has-big width=800 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can assign different attribute points and match them to create the most suitable attribute scheme for themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduction to the Life Weapon System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/4f4e99559c2106f9c285e7d2bbca00e0.avif?t=1752120241\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players unlock different skill effects through talent points, making you stronger! By combining attacks from different angles, a more magnificent performance effect can be achieved</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/cc52bf99e709a4c359a4f0eb53d608b5.poster.avif?t=1752120241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/cc52bf99e709a4c359a4f0eb53d608b5.webm?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/cc52bf99e709a4c359a4f0eb53d608b5.mp4?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brilliant visual effects and excellent atomization interaction effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/6bf6143f44faad4cba37bcf5236405b2.poster.avif?t=1752120241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/6bf6143f44faad4cba37bcf5236405b2.webm?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/6bf6143f44faad4cba37bcf5236405b2.mp4?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive drops bring a refreshing sensation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/60ad266d2a270fb0ab6df2a8b4aa3253.poster.avif?t=1752120241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/60ad266d2a270fb0ab6df2a8b4aa3253.webm?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/60ad266d2a270fb0ab6df2a8b4aa3253.mp4?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/6093258917249791e71ab71749ddc41c.poster.avif?t=1752120241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/6093258917249791e71ab71749ddc41c.webm?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754580/extras/6093258917249791e71ab71749ddc41c.mp4?t=1752120241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome everyone to download and try it out, and provide valuable improvement suggestions. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ group: 719286397, welcome to join!</p>",
